  "<size=26>Summer Gift Basket <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Deal Bless damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Minami's Max HP. Then inflict [Candied] on them for $6 turns: When any ally attacks a Candied foe, increase ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> (Increase ATK by $4 more for every $3 of Minami's Max HP, up to <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> Max HP).\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>A wicker basket brimming with sweets descends from above. Beware, for this is a trap cloaked in sugar! Cream bursts forth in all directions, swirling into waves of saccharine bliss.</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size=22>Midsummer Flower Field Lv.$1</size>": "",
  "<size=22>Midsummer Flower Field <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Increase party's DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> for $5 turns (Increase DMG Dealt by $3 more for every $2 of Minami's Max HP, up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> Max HP). Grant party $6 <link=\"s|111\"><u>Blessing</u></link> stack, and cure $7 debuff.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>A gentle breeze stirs the emerald shade, as a vibrant field of flowers blooms beneath their feet. Petals caress the companions with tender grace, bestowing the fragrance of blessings.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Faraway Flower Lv.$1": "",
  "Faraway Flower <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Increase 1 other ally's Crit Rate by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color>, and increase Crit DMG by $3 of the portion of Minami's Crit DMG over $2 (up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> Crit DMG). Lasts for $5 turns.\\nPassive: When Minami uses an item on an ally, increase the main target's Crit DMG by $7 of the portion of Minami's Crit DMG over $6 (up to <color=#FFFC40>$8</color> Crit DMG). Lasts for $9 turn.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>A tender, warm wind carries white blossoms afar, transcending time and distance, they alight beside their companions, awakening the dormant edge within their hearts.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Increase 1 other ally's DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> and Crit DMG by $3 of Minami's Crit DMG that is over by $2, up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> Crit DMG. Lasts for $5 turns. When Minami uses the next item, increase Item Effect by <color=#FFFC40>$6</color>.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Bless damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "When using a Persona skill on allies, grant them $1 <link=\"s|111\"><u>Blessing</u></link> stack. When Minami is present, increase allies' DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> for each <link=\"s|111\"><u>Blessing</u></link> stack they have, up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color>.": "",
  "When using a Persona skill on allies, grant them $1 <link=\"s|111\"><u>Blessing</u></link> stack. When Minami is present, increase allies' DMG Dealt by <color=#0169ca>$3</color> for each <link=\"s|111\"><u>Blessing</u></link> stack they have, up to <color=#0169ca>$4</color>.": "",
  "When Minami is present, increase allies' ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color>. Increase ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> more for each <link=\"s|248\"><u>Buff Item</u></link> effect on allies.": "",
  "When Minami is present, increase allies' ATK by <color=#0169ca>$1</color>. Increase ATK by <color=#0169ca>$2</color> more for each <link=\"s|248\"><u>Buff Item</u></link> effect on allies.": "",
  "Stopping Time for You": "",
  "Minami has $1 unlimited <link=\"s|247\"><u>Exclusive Buff Items</u></link> only she can use. When using an item on allies, restore HP to the main target equal to $2 of Minami's Max HP. When using [Faraway Flower], gain $3 [Flower of Dream] stack. Stacks up to $4 time. At the start of Minami's turn, she can spend $5 [Flower of Dream] to gain [Memory Prescription]. [Memory Prescription]: Can use item without spending an action, extend <link=\"s|248\"><u>Buff Item</u></link> effect by $6 turn, lose this effect after using $7 item.": "",
  "Past Memories": "",
  "When using [Faraway Flower], gain $1 [Flower of Dream] more. Increase the maximum number of [Flower of Dream] stacks to $2. Increase Minami's Item Effect by $3.": "",
