  "r:\"^Deal\\\\s+Bless\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+1\\\\s+foe\\\\s+equal\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Minami's\\\\s+max\\\\s+HP,\\\\s+and\\\\s+grant\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+<link\\=\"s\\\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Blessing</u></link>\\\\s+stack\\\\s+to\\\\s+all\\\\s+allies\\\\.\\\\s+Grant\\\\s+Minami\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+<link\\=\"s\\\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Diagnosis</u></link>\\\\s+stack\\\\.\\\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>A\\\\s+light\\\\s+repelling\\\\s+all\\\\s+injuries\\\\s+and\\\\s+illnesses,\\\\s+granting\\\\s+Blessings\\\\s+to\\\\s+allies\\\\s+and\\\\s+dealing\\\\s+Bless\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+an\\\\s+enemy\\\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Restore\\\\s+HP\\\\s+equal\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Minami's\\\\s+max\\\\s+HP\\\\s+\\\\+\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\\\s+to\\\\s+the\\\\s+ally\\\\s+with\\\\s+the\\\\s+lowest\\\\s+HP\\\\s+and\\\\s+1\\\\s+selected\\\\s+ally,\\\\s+and\\\\s+cure\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+debuffs\\\\.\\\\nGrant\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+<link\\=\\\"s\\|111\\\"><u>Blessing</u></link>\\\\s+stack\\\\s+to\\\\s+allies\\\\s+healed,\\\\s+and\\\\s+grant\\\\s+Minami\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+<link\\=\\\"s\\|169\\\"><u>Diagnosis</u></link>\\\\s+stack\\\\.\\\\nAt\\\\s+the\\\\s+start\\\\s+of\\\\s+each\\\\s+turn\\\\s+for\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+turns,\\\\s+restore\\\\s+HP\\\\s+of\\\\s+allies\\\\s+healed\\\\s+by\\\\s+this\\\\s+skill\\\\s+equal\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Minami's\\\\s+max\\\\s+HP\\\\s+\\\\+\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\\\.\\\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>A\\\\s+warm\\\\s+light\\\\s+that\\\\s+heals\\\\s+wounds,\\\\s+granting\\\\s+Blessings,\\\\s+curing\\\\s+debuffs,\\\\s+and\\\\s+healing\\\\s+allies\\\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Spend\\s+all\\s+<link\\=\\\"s\\|169\\\"><u>Diagnosis</u></link>\\s+stacks,\\s+and\\s+restore\\s+HP\\s+to\\s+selected\\s+ally\\s+equal\\s+to\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\s+of\\s+Minami's\\s+max\\s+HP\\s+\\+\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\.\\s+Also\\s+restore\\s+HP\\s+of\\s+the\\s+ally\\s+with\\s+the\\s+lowest\\s+HP\\s+with\\s+this\\s+effect\\s+(\\d+)\\s+times\\.\\s+For\\s+each\\s+Diagnosis\\s+stack,\\s+activate\\s+this\\s+effect\\s+(\\d+)\\s+more\\s+time\\.\\s+For\\s+each\\s+Diagnosis\\s+stack\\s+spent,\\s+increase\\s+the\\s+max\\s+HP\\s+of\\s+allies\\s+\\(other\\s+than\\s+Minami\\)\\s+by\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\s+of\\s+Minami's\\s+max\\s+HP\\s+for\\s+(\\d+)\\s+turns\\s+\\(up\\s+to\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\)\\.\\s+<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Channels\\s+a\\s+deep\\s+affection\\s+and\\s+spiritual\\s+devotion,\\s+healing\\s+allies\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Highlight：Restore\\\\s+party's\\\\s+HP\\\\s+by\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Minami's\\\\s+max\\\\s+HP\\\\s+\\\\+\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>,\\\\s+and\\\\s+cure\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+debuff\\\\.\\\\nIncrease\\\\s+party's\\\\s+max\\\\s+HP\\\\s+by\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Minami's\\\\s+max\\\\s+HP\\\\s+\\\\(up\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\\\)\\\\s+for\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+turns\\\\.\\\\s+At\\\\s+the\\\\s+end\\\\s+of\\\\s+an\\\\s+action,\\\\s+restore\\\\s+HP\\\\s+equal\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Minami's\\\\s+max\\\\s+HP\\\\s+\\\\+\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\\\s+for\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+turn\\\\.\\\\n1\\\\s+MORE：Deal\\\\s+Bless\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+1\\\\s+foe\\\\.\\\\nMelee\\\\s+Attack：Deal\\\\s+Physical\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+1\\\\s+foe\\\\.\\\\nRanged\\\\s+Attack：Deal\\\\s+Gun\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+1\\\\s+foe\\\\.\\\\s+Can\\\\s+fire\\\\s+until\\\\s+out\\\\s+of\\\\s+ammo\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^After\\s+Minami\\s+heals\\s+an\\s+ally,\\s+increase\\s+that\\s+ally's\\s+damage\\s+by\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\s+\\+\\s+\\(<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\s+×\\s+target\\s+ally's\\s+<link\\=\\\"s\\|111\\\"><u>Blessing</u></link>\\s+stacks\\)\\s+for\\s+(\\d+)\\s+turn\\s+\\(up\\s+to\\s+(\\d+)%\\)\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^At\\s+the\\s+start\\s+of\\s+battle,\\s+increase\\s+party's\\s+max\\s+HP\\s+by\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\s+of\\s+Minami's\\s+max\\s+HP\\s+\\(up\\s+to\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\)\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Deal Bless damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> of Beachflower Minami's max HP, and inflict Bewitching Blossoms for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nBewitching Blossoms: When taking an attack, increase that damage's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> \\+ (\\d+)% more for every (\\d+) of Beachflower Minami's max HP \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color> of max HP\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>The basket is bursting full of summer fun, dealing Bless damage to all enemies\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase party's damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> \\+ ([\\d.]+)% more for every (\\d+) of Beachflower Minami's max HP \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color> of max HP\\) for (\\d+) turns\\. Also, grant all allies (\\d+) <link\\=\\\"s\\|111\\\"><u>Blessing</u></link> stack, and remove (\\d+) debuff\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Lead your friends to a garden of summer blossoms, increasing their damage\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase (\\d+) other ally's critical rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>, and increase critical damage by ([\\d.]+)% of the portion of Beachflower Minami's critical multiplier over (\\d+)% \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> of critical multiplier\\)\\. Lasts for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nPassive: When using medicine on an ally, increase the main target's critical damage for (\\d+) turn\\. This increase is equal to ([\\d.]+)% of the portion of Beachflower Minami's critical multiplier over (\\d+)% \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> of critical multiplier\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Ride on a gentle summer wind, increasing one other ally's critical rate and damage\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Highlight：Increase (\\d+) other ally's damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>, and increase critical damage by ([\\d.]+)% of the potion of Beachflower Minami's critical multiplier over (\\d+)% \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> of critical multiplier\\)\\. Lasts for (\\d+) turns\\. Also, when Beachflower Minami uses medicine, increase medicine effects by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Bless damage to (\\d+) foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to (\\d+) foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to (\\d+) foe\\. Can fire until out of ammo\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Each time a skill is used on allies, grant (\\d+) <link\\=\"s\\|111\"><u>Blessing</u></link> stack to targets\\.\\nWhen Beachflower Minami is present, for each Blessing stack on allies, increase their damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\)\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^When Beachflower Minami is present, increase allies' Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>, and for each type of buff granted by <link\\=\"s\\|248\"><u>Potent Medicine</u></link>, increase Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\.$\"": "",
  "At the start of battle, gain 1 <link\\=\"s|169\"><u>Diagnosis</u></link> stack. On Minami's action, if any ally's HP is below 70%, gain Diagnosis. Diagnosis stacks up to 2 times.": "",
  "When healing allies above max HP, increase target's pierce rate by 20% for 2 turns.": "",
  "When using Healing Grace, heal 1 more ally, and if target's HP is below 50%, increase healing effect by 20%.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Healing Grace and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: The duration of the max HP increase and healing effect increase are extended by 1 turn.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Nurse's Light and Compassionate Cure by 3.": "",
  "Restore a KO'd ally's HP equal to 40% of Minami's max HP + 1200. This effect can be activated once per battle.": "",
  "Beachflower Minami has 3 kinds of <link\\=\"s|247\"><u>Everyday Medicine</u></link>.\\nWhen using medicine on allies, restore HP to the main target equal to 8% of Beachflower Minami's max HP.\\nWhen using Gentle Sea Breeze, grant 1 Midsummer Prescription stack (stacks up to 1 time). At the start of Beachflower Minami's turn, she can spend 1 Midsummer Prescription stack to gain Flower Basket Pharmacy.\\nFlower Basket Pharmacy: Use medicine without spending a turn, and extend the duration of <link\\=\"s|248\"><u>Potent Medicine</u></link> used by 1 turn. After using medicine 1 time, lose this effect.": "",
  "When using Gentle Sea Breeze, gain 1 more Midsummer Prescription stack. Midsummer Prescription now stacks up to 2 times (only 1 Midsummer Prescription stack can be used in a turn).\\nIncrease the effects of medicine used by Beachflower Minami by 20%.": "",
  "When using Beach Basket, inflict Perplexing Petals on the target.\\nPerplexing Petals: Decrease the target's Defense by 30%, and increase critical damage taken by 30% for 3 turns.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Beach Basket and Gentle Sea Breeze by 3.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: Extend the duration of all buffs granted by Highlight to 3 turns. Also, when using medicine, increase medicine effects by 5%.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Summer Garden and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "When using any medicine, items are not spent upon use.\\nExtend the duration of <link\\=\"s|248\"><u>Potent Medicine</u></link> effects by 1 turn. Also, when using medicine on allies with Flower Basket Pharmacy, also grant Summertime Refresh to the main target.\\nSummertime Refresh: Increase final damage amplification by 15% for 1 turn.": "",
